    },
    {
      "s": "The Jabberwock, from the famous poem The Jabberwocky, is the creation of Lewis Carroll.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "724646_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "And I know, I know, Jabberwock would be better suited on drums, but that’s band politics for you!",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "724647_3",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Imagine the band Imagine Dragons included dragons from the imagination of Lewis Carroll. (aside) Pretty straight forward, right? Anyway... What dragon should you be imagining?",
